{"version": 2, "width": 140, "height": 50, "timestamp": 1795131250, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.006669, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m$ node --test scripts/test/setup.test.mjs   # V1 to V3\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.143044, "o", "✔ V1: one command applies the migrations, then starts the Worker in the local emulator and the launcher (2.046828ms)\r\n"]
[1.144043, "o", "✔ V2: the CI job that runs npm test has a real Postgres and applies the roles and the row-level security first (0.781762ms)\r\n"]
[1.144513, "o", "✔ V3: the steps of README.md for a new clone are npm ci, db:setup, doctor, check and npm test, in this order (0.864624ms)\r\n"]
[1.159746, "o", "ℹ pass 3\r\nℹ fail 0\r\n"]
[1.165739, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m$ npx vitest run test-workers/worker.test.ts -t D12   # the queue \"events\" (in apps/platform)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.804068, "o", " \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m test-workers/worker.test.ts \u001b[2m(\u001b[22m\u001b[2m8 tests\u001b[22m\u001b[2m | \u001b[22m\u001b[33m7 skipped\u001b[39m\u001b[2m)\u001b[22m\u001b[33m 2083\u001b[2mms\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\r\n   \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m the interface of the Platform Worker \u001b[2m(8)\u001b[22m\r\n     \u001b[33m\u001b[2m✓\u001b[22m\u001b[39m D12: the queue events gives an ExternalEvent to the Petra of its account, and drops each other command\u001b[33m 1934\u001b[2mms\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[8.809441, "o", "\u001b[2m      Tests \u001b[22m \u001b[1m\u001b[32m1 passed\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\u001b[2m | \u001b[22m\u001b[33m7 skipped\u001b[39m\u001b[90m (8)\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[8.998729, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m$ npm run demo:staging -- fixed   # https://tensquads-platform.moe-678.workers.dev, account with the \"test\" profile\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.189099, "o", "== Account eval-demo-mwo6t4xr-f (profile \"test\", 100 credits). The owner sets a refund limit of $20.\r\n"]
[32.63676, "o", "== The owner sends: \"Please read 3 files then refund 60 to cust-1\"\r\n"]
[92.215648, "o", "== During the task, the owner sends: \"Please put a thank-you note in the box.\"\r\n"]
[110.555688, "o", "   Petra: I gave your message to the task eval-demo-mwo6t4xr-f-task.\r\n"]
[189.231796, "o", "== Petra asks for an approval: refund, amount 60000000, limit 20000000\r\n"]
[194.077261, "o", "   The task is \"waiting for the owner\". Its sandbox stopped.\r\n"]
[196.225997, "o", "== The owner approves the exact content (its hash)\r\n"]
[271.327152, "o", "== The task is done after attempt 2\r\n"]
[272.377696, "o", "== The result:\r\nResult: Please read 3 files then refund 60 to cust-1\r\nMessage: Please put a thank-you note in the box.\r\nThe shop opens at 9:00 and closes at 17:00, from Monday to Saturday.\r\nThe shop opens at 9:00 and closes at 17:00, from Monday to Saturday.\r\nThe shop opens at 9:00 and closes at 17:00, from Monday to Saturday.\r\n{\"outcome\":\"confirmed\",\"actionId\":\"eval-demo-mwo6t4xr-f-task/call-4\"}\r\n"]
[272.378129, "o", "\r\n== The messages to the owner\r\n"]
[273.33225, "o", "   reply: I started the task eval-demo-mwo6t4xr-f-task.\r\n   reply: I gave your message to the task eval-demo-mwo6t4xr-f-task.\r\n   approval_request\r\n   approval_decided\r\n   result\r\n"]
[273.33232, "o", "\r\n== The trail of the task (admin trail call)\r\n"]
[275.304363, "o", "   -/- owner message        owner    The owner asked for a task.\r\n   -/- message to the owner petra    Petra sent a message of the type reply to the owner.\r\n   1/1 model call           test-bot The model answered in turn 1.\r\n"]
[275.304991, "o", "   1/1 tool use             test-bot The shop opens at 9:00 and closes at 17:00, from Monday to Saturday.\r\n   -/- message to the owner petra    Petra sent a message of the type reply to the owner.\r\n   1/2 model call           test-bot The model answered in turn 2.\r\n   1/2 tool use             test-bot The shop opens at 9:00 and closes at 17:00, from Monday to Saturday.\r\n   1/3 model call           test-bot The model answered in turn 3.\r\n   1/3 tool use             test-bot The shop opens at 9:00 and closes at 17:00, from Monday to Saturday.\r\n"]
[275.30501, "o", "   1/4 model call           test-bot The model answered in turn 4.\r\n   -/- message to the owner petra    Petra sent a message of the type approval_request to the owner.\r\n   1/- check                test-bot The result stands: A result with the stop waiting has no check.\r\n   -/- approval             owner    The owner approved the action call-4.\r\n   2/4 tool use             test-bot {\"outcome\":\"confirmed\",\"actionId\":\"eval-demo-mwo6t4xr-f-task/call-4\"}\r\n   2/5 model call           test-bot The model answered in turn 5.\r\n   2/- check                test-bot The result stands: Checker model: The result is not empty and not marked wrong.\r\n   -/- message to the owner petra    Petra sent a message of the type result to the owner.\r\n"]
[275.305233, "o", "\r\n== The credits of the account\r\n"]
[275.325172, "o", "   grant      100\r\n   charge     -1\r\n\r\n== The decision records\r\n"]
[275.34134, "o", "   request-clear      fixed    yes (used true)\r\n   which-bot          fixed    test-bot (used true)\r\n   message-for-task   fixed    eval-demo-mwo6t4xr-f-task (used true)\r\n"]
[275.34138, "o", "\r\n== The actions (one row for each action)\r\n"]
[275.357029, "o", "   refund done\r\n"]
[275.357209, "o", "\r\n== The cost rows of the task (millionths of a US dollar; a sandbox row depends on the time)\r\n"]
[275.373465, "o", "   large model     test/rule            210 1M input tokens = 630\r\n"]
[275.373712, "o", "   large model     test/rule            0 1M output tokens = 0\r\n   sandbox         launcher/            <time> 1k seconds = <time>\r\n   large model     test/rule            442 1M input tokens = 1326\r\n   large model     test/rule            0 1M output tokens = 0\r\n   sandbox         launcher/            <time> 1k seconds = <time>\r\n   large model     test/rule            713 1M input tokens = 2139\r\n"]
[275.37379, "o", "   large model     test/rule            0 1M output tokens = 0\r\n"]
[275.373834, "o", "   sandbox         launcher/            <time> 1k seconds = <time>\r\n   large model     test/rule            945 1M input tokens = 2835\r\n"]
[275.374005, "o", "   large model     test/rule            0 1M output tokens = 0\r\n   outside service test-payment/        1 call = 300000"]
[275.374013, "o", "\r\n"]
[275.374185, "o", "   sandbox         launcher/            <time> 1k seconds = <time>\r\n   large model     test/rule            1199 1M input tokens = 3597\r\n   large model     test/rule            378 1M output tokens = 5670\r\n"]
[275.374507, "o", "   checker model   test/rule-check      1 call = 200\r\n"]
[275.37452, "o", "\r\n== The cost view of the account (admin view; the sandbox time differs between runs)\r\n"]
[276.295092, "o", "   cost             <time>\r\n   worker           0\r\n   decider          200\r\n   sandbox          <time>\r\n   storage          0\r\n   database         0\r\n   account_id       eval-demo-mwo6t4xr-f\r\n   difference       <time>\r\n   large_model      57300\r\n"]
[276.295355, "o", "   credits_used     1\r\n   checker_model    200\r\n   outside_service  300000\r\n"]
[277.470224, "o", "exit code: 0\r\n"]
